"""Preflight and farm dispatch for the BMFX Render Dispatcher LOP.

The HDA is deliberately small: it is a pass-through Python LOP with a single
visible *Preflight Check* button.  The button opens :class:`RenderDispatcherDialog`,
which reads RenderVars, RenderPasses, RenderSettings and RenderProducts from the
incoming USD stage.  A dispatch stores the chosen paths in hidden HDA parameters,
saves one filtered HIP snapshot per pass and submits those snapshots to Deadline.

The module keeps USD and Deadline access behind small functions so importing it
outside Houdini (for linting/tests) remains possible.
"""

